# ── Zenith analytics ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.local for local dev. Both values below are PUBLIC by design:
# they ship inside the tracking snippet on every page, and the site key can
# only WRITE events. There is nothing here worth hiding.
#
# BOTH MUST BE BUILD ARGS in Docker, not just runtime env. A prerendered page
# reads them at build time; set only at runtime, the tracker never appears in
# the HTML no matter what the container environment says.
ZENITH_URL=https://analytics.gritframework.dev
ZENITH_SITE_KEY=zk_o84KgGIkU3QNkH4bC4pURnxsoeFwbmq3OfL1PeIowr4

# Secret, runtime-only, and NOT required for tracking — it is read only by a
# dashboard route, which this site does not mount. Set it here only if you later
# want to read aggregates back out for the install-count badges.
# ZENITH_API_KEY=
